---

<section class="team-hero" aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <div class="team-hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">TEAM</p>

    <div class="title-wrapper">
      <h1 id="team-title">The Consultors</h1>
      <span class="yellow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="intro">
      Our success stems from the synergy between dedicated teams and our valued
      clients. We prioritize a company culture that fosters exceptional
      productivity, ensures customer satisfaction.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .team-hero {
    position: relative;
    inline-size: 100%;
    background-color: var(--color-neutrals-50);
    color: var(--color-neutrals-900);
  }

  .team-hero-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    max-inline-size: 1200px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem 4.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .title-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .team-hero h1 {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .yellow-line {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0.25rem;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 4px;
    background-color: var(--color-action);
  }

  .intro {
    max-inline-size: 540px;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .team-hero-inner {
      padding: var(--space-7) 1.5rem var(--space-8);
    }

    .team-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 8vw, 2.4rem);
    }

    .intro {
      max-inline-size: 450px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>
